        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1310",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I'm amazed at how well the Nood Flasher ",
            "text": "I'm amazed at how well the Nood Flasher Pro is working. I've always struggled with sensitive skin in my bikini area, and have tried other laser devices that were ineffective and sooo painful. I'm ecstatic that I tried Nood! Here's what I love: 1) The laser window is fairly large, so it covers a large area pretty quickly. I did an entire leg in only 10 minutes. 2) It's a very tolerable treatment in terms of burning/stinging sensation. I can use it on the highest setting, and while it can sting, it's completely tolerable, and the cooling mechanism helps. On some areas of my body it feels like a warm flash and doesn't hurt at all. After treatment, I have felt a very mild sting for a few minutes, up to maybe 30 minutes at most. 3) The ageless lens is a great bonus! I've used it to reduce sun damage/redness on my chest and face, and it's working, though with less obvious results than the hair removal. 4) My bikini lines are mostly smooth and hairless after only 3 quick treatments! Amazing!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1311",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The only thing that I don't love is that",
            "text": "The only thing that I don't love is that since the laser window is so large, it's difficult to treat areas that aren't flat enough for the laser to engage, such as collarbone, nose, ankles. Otherwise, this is a fantastic investment!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
