        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1437",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Okay, guys, before I start I must conced",
            "text": "Okay, guys, before I start I must concede that this is an incentivized review, BUT, would have done it regardless. Now that that’s out of the way, the Nood Flasher Pro WORKS. And it works well.",
