        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1438",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · One other important note, is that I’m a ",
            "text": "One other important note, is that I’m a hairy man with a White Olive skin tone per their chart with brown / black hair, so objectively a good candidate.",
