        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1439",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I want this to be helpful because I was ",
            "text": "I want this to be helpful because I was once in your shoes, sitting there with your hairy hands and arms staring back at you, scouring through reviews, sorting by Lowest rating, trying to decide if the big price tag was worth it. And then you go on Reddit and everyone loses their minds for Braun (I get it, massive brand name). I went with Nood and am happy I did AS IT WORKS.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1440",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I am about 8 weeks in as they just remin",
            "text": "I am about 8 weeks in as they just reminded me, using the device, as recommended, CONSISTENTLY, approx every other day, usually on the second high test setting (ouchie on the back and hands, as a heads up!). I decided to start on my hands, triceps, shoulders, front and back of the neck, stomach, and back (so, basically everything 😂). It typically takes ten minutes or so to do everything (save the back, which my wife does separately as this is a larger project 🤓).",
